@*
    Interactivity with no prerender pass, so nothing renders until the circuit is connected and
    everything a test sees here is the interactive render. That is what makes it the honest home
    for the validation smoke: no assertion on this page can be answered by prerendered markup.
*@
@page "/interactive"
@rendermode @(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))

<h1>Interactive</h1>

<ContactForm />
